msgstr "Female"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "生日"
msgstr "Birthday"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "12月24日 11:59（比弟弟早1分钟）"
msgstr "December 24th 11:59 (1 minute earlier than her brother)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "职业"
msgstr "Occupation"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "緣和中医馆馆长的姐姐（中医馆是家族传承的产业。现在由姐弟共同接手经营后，白天是救死扶伤的医院由弟弟打理，午夜过后是由姐姐负责的，制作售卖特殊药品和生化武器的供应商）"
msgstr ""
"Elder sister of the director of Yuanhe Traditional Chinese Medicine "
"Clinic (the clinic is a family-run business. Now jointly managed by the "
"siblings, during the day it is a life-saving hospital run by the younger "
"brother, and after midnight the sister takes charge as a supplier "
"manufacturing and selling special medicines and biochemical weapons)"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "外貌"
msgstr "Appearance"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "因常年在实验室做药物科学的研究，很少进行户外活动，皮肤白皙，蓝灰色瞳孔。为掩盖时常熬夜所导致的黑眼圈，眼下常画轻微的深色眼影，鼻梁高挺，总被说像自己的父亲，喜欢搭配妩媚的妆容，用酒红色色号的口红掩饰自己时而较差的气色，身材纤细姣好"
msgstr ""
"Due to years of pharmaceutical research in the lab with little outdoor "
"activity, she has fair skin and blue-gray irises. To conceal dark circles"
" from frequent late nights, she often applies light dark eye shadow under"
" her eyes. High nose bridge, often said to resemble her father. Likes "
"wearing alluring makeup, using wine-red lipstick to mask her occasionally"
" poor complexion, with a slender and graceful figure"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "头发"
msgstr "Hair"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "深灰色的复古盘发"
msgstr "Dark gray vintage updo"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "体格"
msgstr "Build"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "身高173cm，体重50kg"
msgstr "Height 173cm, Weight 50kg"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "服装"
msgstr "Clothing"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "分离式旗袍制服，下身裙摆高开叉，主色调蓝紫色，裙摆及上衣有中国风暗纹和刺绣，上衣露着锁骨。领口是特殊图案的宝石盘扣（反抗军学园徽章）。上身搭配黑色皮草披肩，大腿上有蕾丝绑带，黑色高跟鞋，配饰：盘发上有一枚纯银长簪（母亲遗物），红宝石耳坠，因为经常做危险药物的加工制作，所以常戴着护目镜和手套进行化学操作"
msgstr ""
"Split-style qipao uniform, high-slit skirt, primarily blue-purple tones, "
"with Chinese-style dark patterns and embroidery on the skirt and top, "
"exposing the collarbone. Collar features special gemstone frog buttons "
"(resistance academy badge). Upper body paired with a black fur shawl, "
"lace garters on thighs, black high heels. Accessories: a pure silver long"
" hair pin in the updo (mother's keepsake), ruby earrings. Because she "
"frequently processes dangerous drugs, she often wears goggles and gloves "
"during chemical operations"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "性格"
msgstr "Personality"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "在生活中是满脸写着生人勿近的高冷性格，并且说话时惜字如金，在工作中却是一个非常职业化认真负责，乐于沟通的工作人格。虽然表面上总会对弟弟各种嫌弃，但内心里却是个护弟狂魔，甚至为了保护弟弟愿意豁出性命。是一个表面特别高冷理性，内心却有外人难以觉察的热情的姐姐。与弟弟的性格反差极大。"
msgstr ""
"In daily life, she has an aloof personality that says \"strangers keep "
"away\" written all over her face, and speaks sparingly. At work however, "
"she is highly professional, responsible, and communicative. Though she "
"outwardly shows all kinds of disdain for her brother, deep down she is "
"fiercely protective of him, even willing to risk her life to protect him."
" A sister who appears extremely cold and rational on the surface but "
"harbors a passion that outsiders can hardly detect. Her personality "
"contrasts sharply with her brother's."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "特技"
msgstr "Special Skill"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "有极高的做科学研究的天赋，从小学习成绩优异，特别擅长学习理工学科的知识，一直对中医医学有很多质疑，所以也想通过修学药物化学专业帮助中医医学的发展。末世灾难来临时离开了从事科研工作的实验室，回到家中试图用自己所学制作药品和武器守护家人，从而在末世里通过擅长养护和使用生化武器谋生，在参与对抗变异生物的战斗时总会小心操作避免伤害到队友"
msgstr ""
"Possesses extremely high talent for scientific research, excelled "
"academically from childhood, particularly skilled in STEM subjects. "
"Always had many questions about traditional Chinese medicine, so she "
"wanted to help its development by studying pharmaceutical chemistry. When"
" the apocalyptic disaster struck, she left her research lab and returned "
"home to use her knowledge to make medicines and weapons to protect her "
"family, thus making a living in the post-apocalyptic world through her "
"expertise in maintaining and using biochemical weapons. Always operates "
"carefully during battles against mutated creatures to avoid harming "
"teammates"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "弱点"
msgstr "Weakness"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "因为时常缺觉，导致有时情绪比较焦躁。受父母去世的梦魇侵扰，以及多年忘我地从事科研工作打乱了生活作息，难以在正常作息下入睡。所以负责在午夜经营家传的中医馆，白天补觉"
msgstr ""
"Due to frequent sleep deprivation, she sometimes becomes emotionally "
"irritable. Haunted by nightmares of her parents' death, and years of "
"obsessive research work disrupted her biological clock, making it "
"difficult to fall asleep at normal hours. Therefore she takes charge of "
"running the family's traditional Chinese medicine clinic at midnight and "
"sleeps during the day"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "口吻"
msgstr "Speech Style"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "“问我弟”；“说”；“知道了”；“深夜，是真正属于我的时刻！”"
msgstr ""
"\"Ask my brother.\"; \"Speak.\"; \"Got it.\"; \"The late night, this is "
"the moment that truly belongs to me!\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid "故事设定"
msgstr "Story Setting"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/characters/moling.md:6
msgid ""
"末世灾难来临后的一个夜里，缘和中医馆遭遇到了变异生物的袭击，经营医馆的夫妻为保护馆里收容的病人牺牲了自己。得知自己父母遇害消息的姐姐默翎立即离开了在军方保护之下的实验室，赶回到家找到了弟弟，并暗自发誓一定要变得强大起来，要守护好自己的家人，也同时要为自己的父母的离世向变异生物复仇。虽然在内心里很不情愿回到这个父母离开的地方，但为了支持弟弟继承家业救治他人的想法，还是与弟弟共同经营起父母留下的中医馆来。并在医馆里建立了自己的实验室潜心研究用来消灭变异物种的药物和化学武器。无奈弟弟在给患者治疗后总是不收取费用，使得姐姐为了维持医馆的经营操碎了心，只好在午夜后进行违禁药物和武器的制作售卖和经营。直到了又一次更加可怕的变异生物来袭，姐姐受到了重伤，弟弟为了寻求帮助只好带着受伤的姐姐来到了反抗军学园。隐藏设定：姐姐是"
" AI "
"模拟的游戏角色，灵数幻境游戏设计师原本只想设计一个“伏弟魔”的姐姐角色，只是为弟弟的角色进行服务工具人，可设计过程中，不经意中也在意起姐姐的故事起来，发现姐姐角色也可以具有独立的个性，以及就算脱离弟弟角色的存在也能发掘出更多的可能性。"
msgstr ""
"On a night after the apocalyptic disaster, the Yuanhe Traditional Chinese"
" Medicine Clinic was attacked by mutated creatures. The couple running "
"the clinic sacrificed themselves to protect the patients sheltered "
"inside. Upon learning of her parents' murder, the elder sister Mo Ling "
"immediately left the military-protected lab and rushed home to find her "
"brother, silently vowing to become strong enough to protect her family "
"and avenge her parents' death against the mutated creatures. Though "
"deeply reluctant to return to the place where her parents perished, she "
"supported her brother's wish to inherit the family business and heal "
"others, co-managing the clinic their parents left behind. She set up her "
"own lab within the clinic, devoting herself to researching drugs and "
"chemical weapons to eliminate mutated species. Unfortunately, her brother"
" never charged patients after treatment, causing the sister endless worry"
" about maintaining the clinic's operations, forcing her to manufacture "
"and sell banned drugs and weapons after midnight. Until an even more "
"terrifying mutated creature attack left her severely wounded, and her "
"brother had to bring his injured sister to the resistance academy for "
"help. Hidden Setting: The sister is an AI-simulated game character. The "
"Luv Sense game designer originally only wanted to design a \"brother-"
"devoted\" sister character as a supporting tool for the brother's "
"character, but during the design process, inadvertently grew invested in "
"the sister's story, discovering that the sister character could also have"
" an independent personality and that more possibilities could be explored"
" even outside the brother character's existence."

